  "job_B3.2.11.5_20251003_114612": {
    "chunk_text": "bio\u00f0 oferswi\u00f0de \u00feurh \u00fea forh\u00e6fdnesse. So\u00f0lice to witanne is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6t f\u00e6sten myclum frama\u00fe, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t folc on Niniuen \u00fe\u00e6re byrig gef\u00e6ston Israhela folc gef\u00e6ston \u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6re Easterlican symbelnesse, \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t hie geearnodon \u00fea Readan S\u00e6 Moyses gef\u00e6ste on \u00feam westenne, \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t he geearnode gehyran \u00fea heofonlican geryno. Dauid se cyning \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6re \u00feurhtogenan synne gef\u00e6ste, \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t he geearnode \u00fea ylcan scylde Crist sylf gef\u00e6ste xl daga & xl nihta, \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t he oferswi\u00f0de \u00feone wi\u00f0erwinnan, & him sona englas Petrus gef\u00e6ste, \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t he geearnode \u00feone engel geseon, se hine of \u00feam carcernne alysde. Iohannes se godspellere gef\u00e6ste, \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t he geearnode \u00fea godcundan gerynu gehyran, swa him se Paulus gef\u00e6ste, \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t he geearnode bion geh\u00e6led of \u00fe\u00e6re blindnesse & fulluhtes onfon. Hieronimus cw\u00e6\u00f0: Swa lange swa Adam hine geh\u00e6fde \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6ples ne abyrgde, he wunude on Sona swa he \u00fe\u00e6s of\u00e6tes on\u00feah, swa w\u00e6s he drifen. Bro\u00f0or \u00fea leofestan, swi\u00f0e god is \u00fe\u00e6t f\u00e6sten mid gebede. For \u00feam sio gemetf\u00e6stnes is halwendlic, & swa hw\u00e6t swa bi\u00f0 to swi\u00f0e & ofer gemet, \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0 To witanne is weotodlice \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t f\u00e6sten",
